OL,3,GNEWSABrit School North arts college
OL,4,Aplan given go-ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for the north of England's first
OL,7,FBrit School-inspired performing arts
OL,8,Fcollege have been approved.
OL,10,FInspired by the world-famous arts
OL,11,Facademy in London which produced
OL,12,Ftalents such as Adele and Tom Holland,
OL,13,FBrit North is expected to bring more
OL,14,Fthan 550 students and staff into the
OL,15,Fcity centre.
OL,17,FThe college will be housed on the site
OL,18,Fof the former Jacob's Well council
OL,19,Fbuilding, which is currently a car
OL,20,Fpark, and aims to open by 2028.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
